                "name": "💡 Helpful Tips",
                "value": "• **Arrive on time** (7:00 PM sharp)\\n• **Look for the group** - introduce yourself!\\n• **Order separately** - everyone pays for their own meal\\n• **Be present** - put phones away and enjoy the conversation\\n• **Exchange contacts** if you connect with someone",
                "inline": false
